OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric pub objects to plan for
OL,4,A17-storey tower nearby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic Manchester pub that has
OL,7,Fdrawn visitors from around the world is
OL,8,Ffearing for its future amid plans for a
OL,9,Flarge tower to be built nearby.
OL,11,FThe Marble Arch has been serving pints
OL,12,Fon Rochdale Road since 1888 when Queen
OL,13,FVictoria sat on the throne and the city
OL,14,Fwas rapidly industrialising.
OL,16,FPlans by the McGoff Group to build a
OL,17,F17-storey tower with 153 flats next to
OL,18,Fthe Grade II-listed pub have prompted
OL,19,Fconcerns about the visual impact and
OL,20,Fthe pub's continued existence.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
