OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric pub objects to plan for
OL,4,A17-storey tower nearby
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester City Council said it
OL,7,Faccepted "some visual harm" would be
OL,8,Fcaused as a result of the building
OL,9,Fgoing up, but would be "outweighed by
OL,10,Fthe substantial public and regeneration
OL,11,Fbenefits that the proposal would
OL,12,Fdeliver".
